---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import "../styles/global.css";
---

<Layout title="About - Tailspin Toys">
  <section class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 py-8">

    <!-- Page heading -->
    <div class="mb-10">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-purple-500/10 border border-purple-500/30 text-purple-400 text-sm font-medium mb-4">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-3.5 w-3.5" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor">
          <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M18 10a8 8 0 11-16 0 8 8 0 0116 0zm-7-4a1 1 0 11-2 0 1 1 0 012 0zM9 9a1 1 0 000 2v3a1 1 0 001 1h1a1 1 0 100-2v-3a1 1 0 00-1-1H9z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
        </svg>
        Our Story
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-3">About Tailspin Toys</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-400 text-lg">Where developer culture meets tabletop adventure.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Main content card -->
    <div class="bg-slate-800/70 backdrop-blur-sm border border-slate-700 rounded-xl shadow-xl overflow-hidden mb-10">
      <div class="h-1 w-full bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-500 to-purple-500"></div>
      <div class="p-8 space-y-6">
        <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-300">
          Tailspin Toys is the premier crowdfunding platform dedicated to bringing board games with a development and DevOps twist to life. We believe that the same collaborative spirit, iteration cycles, and problem-solving that power modern software teams can make for endlessly engaging tabletop experiences. By focusing exclusively on games that explore themes like continuous integration, agile planning, container orchestration, and incident response, we offer a unique space where both seasoned developers and curious newcomers can back - and even contribute to - the games they're most passionate about.
        </p>

        <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-300">
          Our platform empowers creators at every stage of the design journey. From early-concept sketches through final prototype testing, Tailspin Toys provides tools for community feedback, stretch-goal planning, and beta-play sessions. Backers can join forums to share house rules, vote on art directions, or fund expansion modules that introduce new mechanics like "pipeline bottleneck" challenges or "rollback" rescue cards. We handle all the logistics of manufacturing and fulfillment, so designers can focus on the fun stuff - and supporters can look forward to high-quality components delivered right to their door.
        </p>

        <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-300">
          The name "Tailspin Toys" reflects our love of both flight metaphors and that moment when a project takes on a life of its own - spinning through sprints, releases, and hotfixes until it soars. Founded by a team of developers who were always gamers at heart, we know firsthand how satisfying it is to conquer a tricky bug or pull off a flawless deployment - and how much more rewarding it can be to do beat your friends on a table (or work with them cooperatively to win together). Whether you're here to back your next favorite game or to launch your own DevOps-inspired design, welcome aboard. Let's game from here, together!
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Feature cards -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-12">

      <!-- Community card -->
      <div class="bg-slate-800/60 backdrop-blur-sm border border-slate-700/50 rounded-xl p-6 hover:border-blue-500/40 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-blue-500/5 transition-all duration-300">
        <div class="w-11 h-11 bg-blue-500/15 border border-blue-500/30 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-6 w-6 text-blue-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-slate-100 font-semibold text-lg mb-2">Community-Driven</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Shape the games you love through forums, voting, and direct feedback with designers.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Transparent card -->
      <div class="bg-slate-800/60 backdrop-blur-sm border border-slate-700/50 rounded-xl p-6 hover:border-purple-500/40 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-purple-500/5 transition-all duration-300">
        <div class="w-11 h-11 bg-purple-500/15 border border-purple-500/30 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-6 w-6 text-purple-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-slate-100 font-semibold text-lg mb-2">Transparent Process</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Track every campaign milestone, from prototype to production, with full visibility.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Developer-themed card -->
      <div class="bg-slate-800/60 backdrop-blur-sm border border-slate-700/50 rounded-xl p-6 hover:border-emerald-500/40 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-emerald-500/5 transition-all duration-300">
        <div class="w-11 h-11 bg-emerald-500/15 border border-emerald-500/30 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-6 w-6 text-emerald-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 20l4-16m4 4l4 4-4 4M6 16l-4-4 4-4" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-slate-100 font-semibold text-lg mb-2">Dev-Themed Games</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Exclusively curated games built around CI/CD, agile, containers, and developer culture.</p>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Back button -->
    <div class="flex justify-center">
      <a href="/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-purple-600 hover:from-blue-500 hover:to-purple-500 text-white rounded-xl font-semibold transition-all duration-200 shadow-lg shadow-blue-500/20 hover:shadow-blue-500/30 hover:-translate-y-px">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-5 w-5" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor">
          <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M9.707 14.707a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 010-1.414l4-4a1 1 0 011.414 1.414L7.414 9H15a1 1 0 110 2H7.414l2.293 2.293a1 1 0 010 1.414z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
        </svg>
        Back to Games
      </a>
    </div>

  </section>
</Layout>